{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メレブに\"スイーツ\"と\"チョヒャド\"と\"ナギ\"の\n呪文をかけて欲しい、斎藤ちはるです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、勇者ヨシヒコにハマってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもとても！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更かよ！って思うでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも7日から新シリーズ始まるんだよ( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみすぎて早く眠って時を過ぎさせたいよ( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇者ヨシヒコの中では特に\nメレブと仏が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまりムロツヨシさんと佐藤二朗さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メレブの「うむ」と「ばかムラサキばか」と\n話し方とヨシヒコの純粋さにうろたえる姿、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仏が呼ばれたのに気付いてなくて\nびっくりして何度見もする所と、\n意地っ張りな所と話し方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして演技が上手すぎる( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もそうなりたい。憧れです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福田雄一監督とは\n「16人のプリンシパルtrois」で\nご一緒させていただき\nその時も本当に楽しかったし台本も監督も\n全て面白くて幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつかご一緒できる機会が\nあればいいなと切々願っておりますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇者ヨシヒコ、一番好きなドラマ！\nと言っても過言ではない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7日楽しみ〜グッズも欲しい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/06/7992617/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は別冊カドカワの私の連載\n\"戦国見聞録\"のオフショットを載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小田原城、物凄く楽しかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい知識を得たり\n楽しんで学ぶことが好きなので\nただただ私の楽しい時間でした( ˘ω˘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中々詳しくは知り得なかった事を\n沢山知れてまた１つ、戦国が好きになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非内容も読んでほしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/06/7992617/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲の白と背景の白が同化して\n境目が分からなくなり困惑。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイ軍配を持ちながら、\n小田原城と撮りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん！\nそして、そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いぞ金箔！！\n豪華だ金箔！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/06/7992617/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで！と私が描いたデザインも\nこんなにカッコよくなるとは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物凄い嬉しいし大切にしますし\nもっともっと学ぼう！と思えます(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/06/7992617/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私のお気に入りショット。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"軍配がぴたりと合う！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分軍配とぴたりと合ったのは\n私だけだと思う！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも何か掲げて撮ったら\n多分面白いと思います\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じにバラエティー豊かな\n小田原城&別冊カドカワ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非見てくださいm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「涙がこぼれそう」Champagneさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声も好きだけど\nこの落ち着いたロックなテンポが\nとても好き。\n演奏かっこいいな〜\nそして歌詞も。\n\"今この両目から涙がこぼれそう\n笑い笑い笑い過ぎて涙がこぼれそう\"\n楽しげだけど私はどこか切ない気がする。\nその雰囲気がいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タピオカはカロリーが高いよ！と\n教えて下さった方も多かったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は敢えて今日、夜ご飯に\nタピオカしか取らないという策をとりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり凄いね！\nお腹にたまる！\nLサイズだったから余計にね！\n逆に逆にカロリー取りすぎてそうだけど！\n気にしないね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、皆さんが教えて下さった\n美術館やら個展やら展示会やら\n時間がある時に行きたいと思います(/´△`＼)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メモメモ_φ(･_･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいつもありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}